repository-code: 'https://github.com/PDB-REDO/density-fitness'
abstract: >-
  density-fitness calculates per-residue electron density
  metrics (real-space R, real-space correlation coefficient,
  EDIAm, and OPIA) based on an input model in mmCIF format
  and reflection data in MTZ format. Map coefficients are
  used if available, otherwise maps are calculated
  on-the-fly. Both X-ray and electron diffraction are
  supported. The output is presented in JSON format.
keywords:
  - Electron density
  - RSR
  - RSCC
  - map validation
  - EDIAm
